      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    trades = [\n        {\"trade_price\": 25.20, \"bid_price\": 25.17, \"ask_price\": 25.20},\n        {\"trade_price\": 25.22, \"bid_price\": 25.19, \"ask_price\": 25.22},\n        {\"trade_price\": 25.27, \"bid_price\": 25.22, \"ask_price\": 25.26},\n    ]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    effective_spreads = []\n    for trade in trades:\n        midpoint = (trade[\"bid_price\"] + trade[\"ask_price\"]) / 2\n        effective_spread = 2 * abs(trade[\"trade_price\"] - midpoint)\n        effective_spreads.append(effective_spread)\n\n    average_effective_spread = sum(effective_spreads) / len(effective_spreads)\n    answer = round(average_effective_spread, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
